WEBVTT

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:03.288
a country and community committed
to not seeing, to denial,

00:04:04.246 --> 00:04:09.413
its denial that makes 50 years of racist
legislation possible while people

00:04:09.413 --> 00:04:11.913
convince themselves that they
are doing nothing wrong.

00:04:13.079 --> 00:04:17.163
And yet I first learned of the destructive
power of denial at

00:04:17.163 --> 00:04:22.621
a personal level before I understood what
it was doing to the country of my birth.

00:04:25.496 --> 00:04:27.121
My father died on a Friday.

00:04:28.163 --> 00:04:30.371
He was 42 years old and I was 15,